      "value": "Posted this on a smaller upvoted post, reposting this comment here for posterity:\nYes! We need this so bad! Literally they could just make the Avatar Documentation button shorter in the Avatar Stats page in the menu and just put an \"Avatar Author\" button that would just take you to that Avatar's Author's profile page, like what happens if you click on someone else with the laser pointer and hit the \"Avatar Author\" button. super easy.\nWould look like this, very easy to get to - https://imgur.com/gallery/VGrLZVn",
